{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into a touching story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The little boy Kiddo has spent most of his life in the hospital. Little does he know what a complicated and fascinating world lies concealed beyond the hospital walls.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Today, on Kiddo's birthday, his mom wasn't around. Instead of her, the boy met Shadow, who inspired him to escape from a hospital and search for his mom.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of Antioma<i>\u00a0</i>in this demo. Help Kiddo escape from a strange hospital by solving eerie puzzles and staying out of sight of the doctors who roam the halls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657280/extras/IMG_2360new.png?t=1747835163\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>What to expect in the demo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Approximately 40 minutes of gameplay<br>\u25cf A first encounter with the mysterious Shadow<br>\u25cf Kiddo\u2019s earliest drawings<br>\u25cf A selection of  puzzles<br>\u25cf Unique and colorful characters<br>\u25cf \u2026and a few unexpected surprises</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657280/extras/NewGIF.gif?t=1747835163\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3657280?t=1747835163","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3657280?t=1747835163","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657280/6a6b29c75b06ae2dfe812ba3957bf3446dc289a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747835163","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657280/6a6b29c75b06ae2dfe812ba3957bf3446dc